# 📖️ Real `DiffCodec::print_diff`/`parse_diff` shape for `Ifc2x3Diff`, hand-rolled since
# `#[derive(dsl::DslDiff)]` fails (`Part21Value` is a genuine data-carrying enum reachable via
# `header`/`upserted_instances`, no `DslField` impl exists — identical root cause `4`'s own
# `IfcValue`/`IfcDiff` doc comment documents for the isomorphic shape). Ticket
# 26/08/10/ARTIFACT-SYSTEM-OVERHAUL-REAL-CODECS-RUNTIME-REUSE-EVOLUTION: this standard had NO
# `DiffCodec` impl at all before this wave (the sole remaining `dsl-migration/diff-completeness`
# breach across all 32 stdio standards, per this ticket's own STATUS.md census) — replaces the old
# ABNF placeholder this file used to contain. One line of space-separated `name=value` tokens, only
# the CHANGED top-level fields present, in declared field order (`schema`/`header`/`removed`/
# `upserted`) — every literal below copied verbatim from `print_ifc2x3_diff`'s real body.
dialect grammar
grammar stdio.ifc.2x3.diff
start document

document = schema-tok? header-tok? removed-tok? upserted-tok?
schema-tok = "schema" "=" hex
header-tok = "header" "=" part21-header
removed-tok = "removed" "=" "[" u64-list "]"
upserted-tok = "upserted" "=" instance-list
u64-list = {INT {"," INT}*}?

# `Part21Value`'s tag scheme (`enc_part21_value`/`dec_part21_value`): `U`/`D` Unset/Derived are BARE
# letters (no brackets — every token boundary is whitespace/`,`/`;`, never ambiguous), `I[n]`
# Integer, `R[n]` Real, `S[hex]` Str, `E[hex]` Enum, `F[n]` reFerence, `A[items]` List (recursive,
# bare comma-list, no self-bracket), `T[hex,[items]]` Typed (recursive, name + its own bracketed
# item list) — same isomorphic shape `4`'s own `IfcValue` tag scheme uses.
part21-value = "U" | "D" | "I" "[" INT "]" | "R" "[" real-num "]" | "S" "[" hex "]" | "E" "[" hex "]" | "F" "[" INT "]" | "A" "[" value-csv "]" | "T" "[" hex "," "[" value-csv "]" "]"
real-num = INT | FLOAT
value-csv = {part21-value {"," part21-value}*}?
part21-value-list = "[" value-csv "]"

# `enc_part21_header`: `[fileDescriptionList,fileNameList,fileSchemaList]` — three self-bracketed
# `part21-value-list`s (same 3-record HEADER shape `4`'s own `IfcHeader` uses).
part21-header = "[" part21-value-list "," part21-value-list "," part21-value-list "]"

# `enc_part21_instance`: `[id,[entity,entity,...]]` — 1 entry for a simple instance, 2+ for a real
# spec-legal COMPLEX instance (ISO 10303-21 §4.2). Each entity is `[hexname,ARGSLIST]`.
entity-item = "[" hex "," part21-value-list "]"
entity-list = {entity-item {"," entity-item}*}?
part21-instance = "[" INT "," "[" entity-list "]" "]"
instance-list = "[" instance-csv "]"
instance-csv = {part21-instance {"," part21-instance}*}?
